{"id":2431,"date":"2026-08-29T03:37:16","date_gmt":"2026-08-29T03:37:16","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2431"},"modified":"2026-08-29T04:20:35","modified_gmt":"2026-08-29T04:20:35","slug":"formatting-emojis","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/emojis\/formatting-emojis\/","title":{"rendered":"Formatting Emojis"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Formatting Emojis<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2449\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FormattingEmojis.webp\" alt=\"Formatting Emojis\" width=\"127\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FormattingEmojis.webp 872w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FormattingEmojis-285x300.webp 285w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FormattingEmojis-768x809.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Unlike standard text-based emojis that rely on your operating system to render-and often look completely different depending on the device you are using-emojis in Open Publisher are powered by a custom, high-quality SVG vector library. This means they scale infinitely without ever losing crispness or becoming pixelated. Because Open Publisher treats these vector emojis as first-class graphical elements rather than standard typed characters, they fully support the advanced formatting, manipulation, and styling features normally reserved for standard pictures and imported photos.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Emoji Picture Tools<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2438\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EmojiPictureTools.webp\" alt=\"Emoji Picture Tools\" width=\"129\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EmojiPictureTools.webp 339w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EmojiPictureTools-300x271.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 129px) 100vw, 129px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Treating emojis as image assets unlocks a new level of design flexibility. When you click on any inserted emoji on your canvas, the <strong>Picture Tools<\/strong> contextual ribbon tab automatically appears at the top of your screen. From this dedicated ribbon, you can:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-2440\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LockAspectRatio.webp\" alt=\"Lock Aspect Ratio\" width=\"47\" height=\"36\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LockAspectRatio.webp 400w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LockAspectRatio-300x230.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 47px) 100vw, 47px\" \/>Lock Aspect Ratio &#8211;<\/strong> Keep your graphics looking professional. By toggling this setting, you ensure your vector emojis stay perfectly proportioned when dragging the corner resize handles, preventing them from becoming accidentally squashed or stretched out of shape.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-2441\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ApplyFilter.webp\" alt=\"Apply Filters\" width=\"43\" height=\"36\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ApplyFilter.webp 374w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ApplyFilter-300x250.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 43px) 100vw, 43px\" \/>Apply Filters &#8211;<\/strong> Open the <strong>Format Picture<\/strong> sidebar to precisely tweak the brightness, contrast, and transparency of the emoji exactly like you would a standard PNG or Clipart graphic. This is highly useful if you want to wash out an emoji to use it as a subtle background watermark.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-2442\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RecolourEngine.webp\" alt=\"Recolour Engine\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RecolourEngine.webp 303w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RecolourEngine-297x300.webp 297w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RecolourEngine-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 45px) 100vw, 45px\" \/>Recolour Engine &#8211;<\/strong> Use the Hue\/Recolour dropdown to completely shift the colour palette of the emoji to match your specific document&#8217;s theme or corporate branding. The native print engine guarantees that your modified emoji colours will print and export to high-resolution PDFs perfectly, maintaining flawless fidelity without any graphical distortion.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Layering and Arrangement<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2436\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LayeringAndAraingment.webp\" alt=\"Layering and Arrangement\" width=\"129\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LayeringAndAraingment.webp 380w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LayeringAndAraingment-300x232.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 129px) 100vw, 129px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Because they function as standalone graphical objects, your formatted emojis can be freely dragged, rotated, and layered anywhere on the page. You can easily send them behind text boxes, bring them to the front of other images, or group multiple emojis together to build custom composite illustrations directly on your canvas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Formatting Emojis Unlike standard text-based emojis that rely on your operating system to render-and often look completely different depending on the device you are using-emojis in Open Publisher are powered by a custom, high-quality SVG vector library. This means they scale infinitely without ever losing crispness or becoming pixelated. Because Open Publisher treats these vector [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2449,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[17],"class_list":["post-2431","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-emojis"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2431","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2431"}],"version-history":[{"count":12,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2431\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2452,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2431\/revisions\/2452"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2449"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2431"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2431"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}